    "text": "The value of the expression <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">∑</mo><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math> is"
